# Icons that keep their own colours. The build forces fill="currentColor" on the
# root, so a shape that should be a fixed colour sets an explicit fill. Shapes
# left on currentColor follow the surrounding text colour.
applepay
googlepay
paypal
venmo
credit-card
calendar
info

